f what price was reacting to prior to taking off. Let me know what you think.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#689","p":28,"im":["9d45f4fb05fcc35f7093b444ecc6c6478a4026de"],"m":689},{"id":"flaglimits_p28_690","t":"Sorry Naas I didn't answer earlier. But I just got back in the house. I set my target at the second target and left. I came back and found that it was hit.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#690","p":28,"im":["6a1c1aea38427c9d9db739c19e450c39e162d856"],"m":690},{"id":"flaglimits_p28_691","t":"and this is my third target","a":"—","d":"","n":"#691","p":28,"im":["838033ffac5ac2226b0cefb607ca6b9c38e8f982"],"m":691},{"id":"flaglimits_p28_692","t":"","a":"—","d":"","n":"#692","p":28,"im":["1540cc442c905b71eda0d7655907a15128a4a9e8"],"m":692},{"id":"flaglimits_p28_693","t":"Right! I have been getting on ok with my homework for flag limits, but still there are a few that crop up that I am still unsure how to mark, and interpret!\n\nThe current GBPAUD graph demonstrates some of the more difficult ones I have found today. I'm obviously going to watch this instrument and see how it plays out as part of my homework, but if others can show me what they see here too, I would be most grateful!\n\nRefusing to move on until I have this flag limit business mastered! It feels like I'm forcing flag limits in sometimes.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#693","p":28,"im":["2e32739dff5812a22dfae606e01429bd4ac70177"],"m":693},{"id":"flaglimits_p28_694","t":"","a":"—","d":"","n":"#694","p":28,"im":["d24ba457ace6f21940cdc12c6ffa6a5db86829e9"],"m":694},{"id":"flaglimits_p28_695","t":"Hello Moogroo,\n\nFor me, I like to go out to a HTF and mark my FL limits. This helps me map a little better. You might find it useful, too","a":"—","d":"","n":"#695","p":28,"im":["a7a752b516bf23e76d105e81189bd0576218ebe5"],"m":695},{"id":"flaglimits_p28_696","t":"","a":"—","d":"","n":"#696","p":28,"im":["6a1e7eb211b6fac45e707fb1aa37a8d15ba7dce1"],"m":696},{"id":"flaglimits_p28_697","t":"Thanks Naascott, what you marked makes sense, defini